# Title: Modification of IE Registry Settings
# ID: d88d0ab2-e696-4d40-a2ed-9790064e66b3
# Status: test
# Level: low
# Author: frack113
# Date: 2022-01-22
# Tags: attack.persistence, attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1112
# Description: Detects modification of the registry settings used for Internet Explorer and other Windows components that use these settings. An attacker can abuse this registry key to add a domain to the trusted sites Zone or insert JavaScript for persistence
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((TargetObject contains "\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Internet Settings") AND NOT (((Details equals "Binary Data") OR (Details="DWORD*") OR (NOT Details=*) OR ((Details equals "Cookie:" OR Details equals "Visited:" OR Details equals "(Empty)")) OR ((TargetObject contains "\\Cache" OR TargetObject contains "\\ZoneMap" OR TargetObject contains "\\WpadDecision")))) AND NOT ((TargetObject contains "\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Internet Settings\\Accepted Documents")))
